# Indexing (src/lib/site.ts):
# - Vercel production needs nothing: it uses the project's production domain
#   (VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL) and allows indexing. Vercel previews are always noindex.
# - Set SITE_URL to use a custom domain for canonicals, sitemap, Open Graph and JSON-LD.
# - SITE_INDEXABLE=false opts production out of indexing.
# - Other hosts: set both SITE_URL and SITE_INDEXABLE=true on the production deployment only.
# Without an indexable configuration the site emits noindex, a disallow-all robots.txt, no canonical
# URLs, an empty sitemap and no absolute social/JSON-LD URLs.

# Absolute https origin of the live site.
SITE_URL=https://212chicken.ma

# "true" to allow indexing on non-Vercel hosts; "false" to opt out anywhere.
SITE_INDEXABLE=true
